{
    "name": "E2E SAP Emarsys - Loyalty Status",
    "description": "End-to-end test for the SAP Emarsys connector - reads the Emarsys Loyalty record of a contact.",
    "notes": {
        "3cad9f52-af02-4e58-b8f2-2cc1a3b5acaf": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 32,
            "width": 928,
            "height": 208,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption - Loyalty is a separate product\n\nEmarsys Loyalty runs on its own host with its own credential; the Core API Client Secret does\nnot work there and the connector cannot create the data this flow reads.\n\n1. Fill **Loyalty API Key** on the connected Emarsys account (Emarsys > Loyalty Configuration >\n   API Key) - it is not the Core API Client Secret.\n2. The loyalty plan must already be **launched**.\n3. Open the **Set Variable** node and set `loyaltyContactId` to the **externalId** of a contact\n   that is enrolled in the plan (the identifier used in the Smart Insight sales data upload,\n   typically the e-mail address or the shop customer ID) - not the internal Emarsys contact ID.\n\nA contact with no loyalty record leaves through `notFound` and the flow stalls until AfterAll times out."
        }
    },
